DATA ATTRIBUTION

The instance data (A-Box) in this repository is derivative of the
publicly maintained political-prisoner registry operated by Prisoners
Defenders (Madrid, Spain) at lista.prisonersdefenders.org. Any
permitted use of this repository must separately acknowledge Prisoners
Defenders as the primary source of the underlying case data:

  Prisoners Defenders (2026). Lista de presos politicos en Cuba.
  https://lista.prisonersdefenders.org/

